WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.257
To join culture, follow four principles.

00:00:03.307 --> 00:00:04.754
Meet people where they are,

00:00:04.804 --> 00:00:06.193
nail tone and timing,

00:00:06.243 --> 00:00:07.408
know the brand's role,

00:00:07.458 --> 00:00:09.634
and subvert your own equity.

00:00:10.333 --> 00:00:13.325
People argued online about how to eat a KitKat.

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:15.908
Snap the fingers, or bite straight in?

00:00:15.958 --> 00:00:18.459
Twenty-seven million engagements.

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:21.476
A debate about your brand is a jackpot.

00:00:21.526 --> 00:00:24.653
KitKat fanned the flames instead of settling it.

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:28.961
So only join a conversation when the brand has a real reason to be there,

00:00:29.011 --> 00:00:31.829
with the right tone at the right moment.
